        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "250gごとの抽選%lld回（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "250gごとの抽選で金が%lld回続けて出なかった場合、次の抽選は金の粒になります。虹はこの回数をリセットしません。" : {
      "comment" : "Gold guarantee rule; %lld is how many draws in a row without gold",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "If %lld draw in a row (one per 250 g) brings no gold, the next draw is a gold gem. A rainbow gem doesn’t reset this count."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "If %lld draws in a row (one per 250 g) bring no gold, the next draw is a gold gem. A rainbow gem doesn’t reset this count."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "250gごとの抽選で金が%lld回続けて出なかった場合、次の抽選は金の粒になります。虹はこの回数をリセットしません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloudのレア粒epochが不整合です。抽選を停止しました。" : {
